<title>Solid Ovarian Mass: Diagnosis.</title>
<graphic href="eee0509-w0001.gif" />
<cell type="start" id="cell-1">
<label>Patient with ovarian mass identified on clinical examination or as incidental finding on imaging</label>
<path target="cell-2"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-2">
<label>Order transabdominal and transvaginal ultrasound; MRI to characterize size, location, and character further if indicated. Benign appearance (eg, smooth mass, few septae, &lt;5 cm)?</label>
<path target="cell-4">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-3">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-3">
<label>Suspected malignancy (eg, irregular shape, &gt;5 cm, ascites)?</label>
<path target="cell-5">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-6">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-5">
<label>CA-125 and laparotomy.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-6">
<label>CA-125 and laparoscopy or surgical exploration</label>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-4">
<label>Premenopausal?</label>
<path target="cell-8">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-7">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-7">
<label>Follow-up ultrasound in 6 wk. Enlarging or change in character?</label>
<path target="cell-6">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-8">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-8">
<label>No further action.</label>
</cell>
</algorithm>
</algorithms>
